ent acts inside a user’s authenticated</description><chr2:heatScore>45.0</chr2:heatScore></item><item><title>Fortinet Patches Nearly 100 Vulnerabilities</title><link>https://www.securityweek.com/fortinet-patches-nearly-100-vulnerabilities/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:56bcf2ecd887e1b6c5ff7c1c308e6e17fbea39d370b126505beff380c96933a4</guid><category>NEWS</category><chr2:sourceName>SecurityWeek</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-11T21:22:02.800703+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:10:14 GMT</pubDate><description>The massive drop comes after the company integrated frontier AI models into its product security testing. The post Fortinet Patches Nearly 100 Vulnerabilities appeared first on SecurityWeek .</description><chr2:heatScore>65.0</chr2:heatScore></item></channel></rss>